{
  "id": 8867218424007,
  "title": "Teal & Yellow Softball Comforter Set – Vibrant Sports Bedroom Decor",
  "handle": "teal-yellow-softball-comforter-set-vibrant-sports-bedroom-decor",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your space with this vibrant Teal &amp; Yellow Softball Comforter Set, perfect for any softball enthusiast. Designed by Jeminise, this comforter set brings a sporty and energetic feel to any bedroom, offering both comfort and style for a relaxing atmosphere.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Type:</strong> Enjoy a complete Comforter Set, ideal for refreshing your bedroom decor.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Sporty Design:</strong> Features a dynamic Softball Design 05, perfect for softball players and fans alike.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Durable Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm) for an ultra-soft, smooth, and long-lasting feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fade-Resistant:</strong> Utilizes environmental protection dyeing techniques to ensure colors remain vibrant for years to come.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Twin (68\"x90\"), Full (79\"x90\"), Queen (90x90\"), and King (104\"x90\") to fit various bed dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Conveniently machine washable and dries quickly, making maintenance simple.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a cozy comforter for a complete bedding solution.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Softball Design 05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Player</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Length</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Fade-Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Fall, Spring, Summer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Recommended Uses for Product</th>\n<td>Napping, Reading, Travel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>360</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of Pieces</th>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
